---
import Section from '../../layout/Section.astro';
---

<Section contained={false} spacing="none" class="relative py-20">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mr-auto ml-auto pr-6 pl-6">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
                <h2 class="font-manrope text-4xl font-normal leading-tight tracking-tight text-white lg:text-5xl">
                    Trusted by Growing Teams
                </h2>
                <p data-garna-subtitle class="mt-6 font-manrope text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
                    There is a simple explanation behind the reason why global businesses partner with Garna: our platform makes the processes easier, safer, and efficient. Here are the proofs
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 min-[961px]:grid-cols-3">
                <article class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#111111] hover:border-white/10">
                    <div class="mb-12 flex items-center gap-4">
                        <img
                            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?w=160&h=160&fit=crop&crop=faces&q=80"
                            alt="Victoria Lang"
                            class="h-14 w-14 rounded-full object-cover"
                            loading="lazy"
                        />
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-manrope text-base font-semibold text-white">Victoria Lang</p>
                            <p class="mt-1 font-manrope text-sm text-gray-500">CFO, Northstar Commerce Group</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="font-manrope text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
                        "Garna helped us consolidate payroll across six entities without forcing every region into the same rigid process. Finance finally has one source of truth for payroll cost, approvals, and reporting"
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#111111] hover:border-white/10">
                    <div class="mb-12 flex items-center gap-4">
                        <img
                            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560250097-0b93528c311a?w=160&h=160&fit=crop&crop=faces&q=80"
                            alt="Marcus Chen"
                            class="h-14 w-14 rounded-full object-cover"
                            loading="lazy"
                        />
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-manrope text-base font-semibold text-white">Marcus Chen</p>
                            <p class="mt-1 font-manrope text-sm text-gray-500">VP Global Operations, MeridianCloud</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="font-manrope text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
                        "We needed payroll infrastructure that could support employees, contractors, and local requirements at the same time. Garna gave our operations team the control we were missing across countries"
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#111111] hover:border-white/10">
                    <div class="mb-12 flex items-center gap-4">
                        <img
                            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580489944761-15a19d654956?w=160&h=160&fit=crop&crop=faces&q=80"
                            alt="Elena Moretti"
                            class="h-14 w-14 rounded-full object-cover"
                            loading="lazy"
                        />
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-manrope text-base font-semibold text-white">Elena Moretti</p>
                            <p class="mt-1 font-manrope text-sm text-gray-500">Head of People Systems, AtlasWorks Enterprise</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="font-manrope text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400">
                        "The biggest change was visibility. Our HR, finance, and compliance teams can now track payroll status, exceptions, and payout timing from one workflow instead of chasing regional providers"
                    </p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </Section>
